{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 10, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of Culture and Wonder\"\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life. In Tokyo, I marveled at the towering skyscrapers and bustling streets of Shibuya, before finding serenity in the beautiful gardens and temples of the Meiji Shrine.\n\nAs I traveled throughout the country, I was amazed by the rich cultural heritage that Japan has to offer. In Kyoto, I witnessed the stunning beauty of the cherry blossoms in bloom, and in Hiroshima, I paid my respects at the Peace Memorial Park. Everywhere I went, I was struck by the warm hospitality of the Japanese people, who welcomed me with open arms and shared their customs and traditions with me.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was trying the delicious Japanese cuisine, from sushi and ramen to tempura and yakitori. I was also fascinated by the unique customs and rituals that are an integral part of Japanese life, such as the traditional tea ceremony and the art of calligraphy.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a journey of discovery and wonder, and I left with a newfound appreciation for this fascinating country and its people. If you're considering a trip to Japan, I highly recommend it - you're sure to be amazed by the beauty, culture, and hospitality that this incredible country has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.659984827041626}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.008935937657952309}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.04860084131360054}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0005254556890577078}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -7.748573807475623e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.030465511605143547}, {"token": " of", "log